              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "k116",
                  "text": "Plain-English intake is the clearest example. When you describe your situation, the model returns each figure with an exact quote from your text. Before anything reaches the calculator, code checks that the quote appears in what you wrote and that it states the amount. A field that fails is not dropped silently. It is capped below the review threshold with the reason attached, and you decide.",
